  "description": {
   "en": "\"Is this person already dead...? \n\nBehind the door, lying in bed, is a grotesque figure...\n\nAkane Kuritani, a new caregiver, arrives at a secluded Western-style mansion deep in the mountains to provide live-in care for Hiwako Miyazono, the bedridden owner. Hoping for a fresh start, Akane is shocked to find Hiwako emanating a putrid smell, with discolored skin and a burlap sack over her face, looking nothing less than a 'corpse.' The nature of the care she must provide is clearly abnormal...\n\nBased on a Kadokawa Horror Bunko novel, a terrifying nursing care horror tale begins."
  },
